====Usage Notes====
The contraction is never obligatory and sometimes avoided in formal written Brazilian Portuguese.<ref>http://portuguese.stackexchange.com/questions/3517/sobre-a-informalidade-de-num-numa-versus-em-um-em-uma-no-brasil</ref>

